    a: { label: 'The school.', key: 'school', text: 'You reach the school with the water at your knees and leave with it at your chest, and every child is on the hill by nightfall, every one, counted by a teacher who cannot stop counting. The shelter\'s Pokémon had nobody. They swam for it. Most made the bank. Three were taken by the river, and nobody knows where it put them down. Far downstream, frightened things that used to have names will be learning to be wild.', together: 'The two of you wade for the school together. The flood has thrown every panicked thing in the river against its doors.' },
