    split: { text: 'You send three to the orchard wall and three to the station fence, with buckets where there is no pump. The fire has driven every wild thing in the valley mad with fear, and they are between your team and the flames. If both halves hold, both fires stop.', foe: 'The Wildfire', sprite: 'houndoom', types: ['fire'], won: 'You fought two fires at once, and both the village and the station were standing at dawn', lost: 'You fought two fires at once, and one of them won' },
    both: 'One of you at the orchard wall, one at the station fence, and the pump cart running between on a road cleared by rangers. At dawn both columns of smoke have thinned to nothing. The village still has its trees. The shed still has its animals. The farmer whose field started all this walks the lane handing out apples, because he has to give somebody something.',
